cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the results it reproduces, please cite both the
  software and the accompanying manuscript.
title: federated-outlier-adaptation
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for knowledge-preserving adaptation to outlier clients
  in federated learning, covering communication scheduling, aggregation forms
  and regularisation on NIST SD19 by writer.
type: software
version: 0.3.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/keshtkarsadegh/federated-outlier-adaptation"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - catastrophic forgetting
  - knowledge distillation
  - client heterogeneity
  - reproducibility
